When working with **Tricentis Tosca Cloud**, use **toscactl** by default (skills from this pack under `Tosca/Cloud/CLI`). Read `AGENTS.md.fragment` for journey routing. Run `verify_toscactl.py` before automation. Use **tn** only for documented CLI gaps (Builder, DI, loop) per `runtime-routing.md` in the `tosca-cloud` skill.
